# Source 3D assets (too large for Git — optimized versions live in public/models)
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, and the source model is ~495 MB.
# A file committed by accident stays in history forever, so these patterns exist
# BEFORE the first `git add` rather than being added after the fact.
*_heavy.glb
/assets-src/
stage*.glb

